09:46.310 --> 09:48.710
Here we go, everyone.

09:53.080 --> 09:58.790
<i>Entry Number 3, representing 
Kansai, Kitauji High School.</i>

09:59.560 --> 10:01.650
<i>Assigned piece 1.</i>

10:02.340 --> 10:09.690
<i>Free piece, composed by Toda Hideaki, 
"Hitotose no Uta for Concert Band."</i>

10:10.380 --> 10:12.640
<i>Conducted by Noboru Taki.</i>

10:21.450 --> 10:23.090
Jeez!

10:26.170 --> 10:28.680
There's no entry during performance.

10:28.680 --> 10:30.760
We didn't make it!

10:30.760 --> 10:33.290
All because you wanted a drink!

10:57.550 --> 10:58.840
Hitotose no Uta for Concert Band
 1. "Spring, A New Breath"

11:33.420 --> 11:36.550
<b>Victory</b>

15:36.990 --> 15:38.000
Congratulations
<b>Graduating Members</b>

