<b>Enjoy sound!</b>

16:36.550 --> 16:37.890
<b>by Hashimocchan</b>

17:21.220 --> 17:23.480
<b>Japan Concert Band Competition</b>

17:42.630 --> 17:45.720
<i>Where is everyone?</i>

17:47.280 --> 17:48.480
<i>Where's Reina?</i>

17:49.570 --> 17:51.040
Are you nervous?

17:51.870 --> 17:53.010
I don't know.

17:53.470 --> 17:55.060
It all happened so fast.

17:55.060 --> 17:56.440
Same.

17:56.430 --> 17:59.930
<b>Japan Concert Band Competition</b>

17:57.140 --> 17:58.720
Thank you for waiting.

17:59.180 --> 18:03.320
We'll hereby announce the results of the 
first half of the high school division.

18:04.130 --> 18:07.710
Number one, Katashiki High School.

18:08.460 --> 18:09.560
Silver.

18:14.610 --> 18:17.780
<i>So much happened in the past three years.</i>

18:19.990 --> 18:25.000
<i>Looking back, every moment 
was special and precious.</i>

18:20.450 --> 18:25.000
Number two, Narai High School, silver.

18:25.980 --> 18:29.840
<i>All the pain, all the grief, all the joy...</i>

18:30.980 --> 18:38.040
<i>No matter what fruit it 
bears, I have no regrets.</i>

18:50.770 --> 18:53.980
Number three, Kitauji High School.

19:03.440 --> 19:05.790
Gold.

19:48.900 --> 19:51.010
We did it, Chihiro-san.

19:52.950 --> 19:55.070
You did it, Taki-kun!

20:06.040 --> 20:08.050
<i>We did it, everyone!</i>

20:10.050 --> 20:11.180
<i>Senpai...</i>

20:12.150 --> 20:13.190
<i>Reina...</i>

20:16.450 --> 20:19.110
I'm so happy, I'm going to die.

22:47.780 --> 22:49.650
And so it begins.

22:51.400 --> 22:52.430
Yes.

22:52.430 --> 22:54.940
How are the new kids this year?

22:54.940 --> 22:56.730
They're very enthusiastic.

22:57.210 --> 22:59.130
Well, I can't wait.

23:17.160 --> 23:19.540
<b>Enjoy music!</b>

23:19.540 --> 23:22.330
Exec Notes

23:19.550 --> 23:21.380
<i>A few years have passed.</i>

23:22.350 --> 23:25.560
<i>Reina's still doing music in America.</i>

23:25.560 --> 23:30.590
<i>Hazuki-chan and Midori-chan 
have both found work.</i>

23:33.010 --> 23:36.530
<i>The high school concert 
band is a strange space.</i>

23:37.690 --> 23:40.250
<i>The roster changes each year, and yet,</i>

23:40.250 --> 23:45.350
<i>each year, they practice in preparation 
for a once-a-year competition.</i>

23:46.280 --> 23:51.570
<i>A lot can go wrong, and a lot 
of it can be infuriating.</i>

23:53.600 --> 23:57.510
<i>Yet, I love this place.</i>

23:58.450 --> 24:02.760
<i>I absolutely love the intense time we spend.</i>

24:03.490 --> 24:08.290
<i>Just three years, 
for just three competitions.</i>

24:17.310 --> 24:17.810
<b>Welcome to the Concert Band!
To the music room!</b>

24:18.470 --> 24:20.600
Gold at the Nationals

24:38.160 --> 24:41.620
I'm Kumiko Oumae, your assistant advisor.

24:42.690 --> 24:49.740
Welcome, new members, 
to the Kitauji Concert Band.

24:51.010 --> 24:56.010
<b>End</b>
